# Copy to .env.local and adjust as needed.

# Where the FastAPI backend is reachable.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000

# Charting note: this app uses TradingView's Lightweight Charts (Apache-2.0),
# not Advanced Charts. Advanced Charts is licensed to companies for public
# projects and is explicitly not available for personal use, hobby study or
# prototyping, so it cannot be used here. Drawing tools are implemented in
# src/components/chart/ChartOverlay.tsx instead. No configuration needed.
